Licensing status of cufhom

The project author has not yet selected a license for the original cufhom code.
This file does not grant additional permissions for that code. The author's
copyright name and the project license must be specified before an open-source
release.

The incorporated and modified FFTHomPy code in src/cufhom_core retains its MIT
license and copyright notice. See src/cufhom_core/LICENSE and
third_party/ffthompy/LICENSE. That notice applies to the incorporated code; it
does not assign a license to the entire cufhom project.
